WEBVTT

NOTE Lumora demo captions — original descriptive text written for this build.
NOTE Film: Tears of Steel (Blender Foundation, CC-BY 3.0).

1
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
[Amsterdam, rooftops. A young couple argues; she walks away]

2
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:06.000
He reaches for her hand — metal fingers close around it. The reveal lands hard.

3
00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:36.000
Forty years later: a research team huddles around a memory-reconstruction rig.

4
00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:06.000
They are rebuilding the past inside a robot's mind, looking for a way to stop the machines.

5
00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:36.000
Outside, drones sweep the ruined city. The timeline is running out.

6
00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:06.000
[Robot footsteps. Sparks. The team arms itself with scavenged weapons]

7
00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:36.000
The assault on the lab begins — gunfire, blades and one very angry robot arm.

8
00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:06.000
In the chaos, a memory surfaces: the moment everything could still have changed.

9
00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:06.000
[End credits: Tears of Steel — Blender Foundation, CC-BY]
